"""Deliberate breaks for S16 (the sandbox: paths, limits, the allow-list, the environment, the OS profile, the runner, the report parser, the service).

Run (the containment ones need a real subprocess, so run with the sandbox tests):
  cd backend && python -u -m scripts.mutation_check scripts/mutants/s16_sandbox.py --tests tests/test_sandbox_files.py tests/test_sandbox_run.py
Every one of these should make the tests FAIL. One that does not is a hole in the tests. The CONTAINMENT group must be caught by a test that really runs a
program (tests/test_sandbox_run.py): a unit test of the profile's text is not proof that the operating system refuses anything.
"""
